<title>USA: Honda February US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Honda February US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honda Motor Co Ltd</p>
<p>			Feb 1-28, 1997     Feb 1-29, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    47,930	    49,675	     +0.5</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   1,796	     1,986	     -5.8</p>
<p> Import Car		11,844	     9,407	    +31.2</p>
<p> Import Truck	     4,719	     2,289	   +114.7</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Feb 28, 1997 Jan 1-Feb 29, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    92,660	    87,215	     +8.4</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   3,826	     4,001	     -2.5</p>
<p> Import Car		22,920	    16,915	    +38.2</p>
<p> Import Truck	     6,189	     4,193	    +50.6</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 24 in latest month vs 25, 50 for year to date vs 51 in year ago.</p>
</text>
